---

This package implements the Mel-Band-RoFormer architecture from
Lu, Wang, Won, Choi, Song, "Mel-Band RoFormer for Music Source Separation"
(arXiv:2310.01809, 2023). The architecture is MIT-licensed via lucidrains/BS-RoFormer
(https://github.com/lucidrains/BS-RoFormer) and the training-time configurations
from ZFTurbo/Music-Source-Separation-Training
(https://github.com/ZFTurbo/Music-Source-Separation-Training).

Individual pre-trained checkpoint licenses are tracked separately on the
mlx-community HuggingFace repos referenced in the README.
